<%# The Messenger entry's unread count, in the pill "nytt!" uses; 99+ keeps the
    pill from growing past its word. The wrapper is always drawn, empty at zero,
    so InboxBroadcastJob has something to replace when the first message lands
    and when the last one is read. %>
<span id="messenger_unread_badge">
  <% if count.positive? %>
    <sup class="nav_link_badge"><%= count > 99 ? "99+" : count %></sup>
    <%= tag.span t("messages.unread_badge", count:), class: "visually-hidden" %>
  <% end %>
</span>
